Burak,

With this dataset, sites differ in shape and sexes differ in shape, but since the interaction term is not significant that means that shape differences in sex are same across sites.

In this case I would perform separate pairwise comparisons for Site and Sex, with and without Size as covariate.

What others think about it?

Best,
Milena

